      "page": "7-12 §7-36 (PDF130), E-2 §E-9/10 (PDF216)",
      "quotes": [
        "The 300 meter zero is the Army standard and works in all tactical situations, including close quarters combat.",
        "The only way to rely on a 300-m hit, is to confirm a 300-m zero."
